3449.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/pull/3449.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Promote the FLAGS registry to a documented, validated single source of truth via a read-only RegistryView, and derive every flag-facing artifact from it: Bash, Zsh, Fish and PowerShell completions, the man page, and -h/--help output.\r\n\r\n- Add RegistryView with registry-wide validation (duplicate/missing-field) and shared category/flag ordering.\r\n- Replace the panicking custom-markup path with a fallible Markup_Renderer that centralizes roff hyphen escaping.\r\n- Generate the Zsh completion's per-flag content from the registry (new !FLAGS! splice point) while keeping the hand-written scaffold and contextual grouping.\r\n- Make value completion consistent across all four shells and complete negated names and aliases everywhere.\r\n- Add a structured Consistency_Checker that reports all divergences; wire its real-registry test as the authoritative CI drift guard, replacing the loose zsh-only ci/test-complete.\r\n- Formalize the --generate command contract and add integration tests.\r\n- Implement all 25 design properties as proptest property tests plus example tests.\r\n\r\nSpec: .kiro/specs/unified-flag-source","closed_by":{"login":"ccclosed","id":205727574,"node_id":"U_kgDODEMnVg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/205727574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ccclosed","html_url":"https://github.com/ccclosed","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ccclosed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ccclosed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ccclosed/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ccclosed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ccclosed/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ccclosed/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ccclosed/repos","events_url":"https://api.gith